   "muc": "II. Kiến thức: phương án đo và xử lí số liệu",
   "neo": "Thí nghiệm hai xe đẩy nhau: trước $p$ bằng bao nhiêu, cần ki",
   "hoi": "Thí nghiệm hai xe đẩy nhau: trước $p$ bằng bao nhiêu, cần kiểm điều gì?",
   "dap": "<ul><li>Trước: $p = 0$</li><li>Sau: $p_1'$ và $p_2'$ ngược dấu</li><li>Kiểm $p' = p_1' + p_2' \\approx 0$, tức $m_1v_1' \\approx m_2v_2'$</li></ul>",
   "tieu_muc": "4. Thí nghiệm 2: hai xe đẩy nhau",
   "hinh": "<figure class=\"fig\" data-tl=\"1\" data-exp=\"tn-l10-thuchanhdl-02\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 262\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sơ đồ bố trí thí nghiệm hai xe đẩy nhau: hai xe đứng yên giữa cổng 1 và cổng 2 với lò xo nén ở giữa; mũi tên chiều dương hướng sang phải; sau khi cắt dây, xe 1 chạy sang trái với vận tốc v1 phẩy, xe 2 chạy sang phải với v2 phẩy\"><defs></defs><rect x=\"16\" y=\"190\" width=\"388\" height=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(128,128,128,.25)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"160\" width=\"56\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(56,189,248,.18)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"161\" y=\"124\" width=\"14\" height=\"36\" fill=\"rgba(248,113,113,.25)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"168.0\" y=\"178.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">xe 1</text><rect x=\"244\" y=\"160\" width=\"56\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(56,189,248,.18)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"265\" y=\"124\" width=\"14\" height=\"36\" fill=\"rgba(248,113,113,.25)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"272.0\" y=\"178.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">xe 2</text><polyline points=\"196,173 202,165 214,181 226,165 238,181 244,173\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"220.0\" y=\"152.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">lò xo</text><rect x=\"56\" y=\"60\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(248,113,113,.25)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"70.0\" y1=\"78.0\" x2=\"70.0\" y2=\"190.0\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" opacity=\"1\"/><text x=\"78.0\" y=\"104.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">cổng 1</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"60\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(248,113,113,.25)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"370.0\" y1=\"78.0\" x2=\"370.0\" y2=\"190.0\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" opacity=\"1\"/><text x=\"362.0\" y=\"104.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"end\">cổng 2</text><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"267.8\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><path d=\"M261.3,35.0 L270.0,40.0 L261.3,45.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\"/><text x=\"278.0\" y=\"45.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">chiều dương</text><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"222.0\" x2=\"92.7\" y2=\"222.0\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M99.5,227.5 L90.0,222.0 L99.5,216.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\"/><line x1=\"290.0\" y1=\"222.0\" x2=\"347.3\" y2=\"222.0\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M340.5,216.5 L350.0,222.0 L340.5,227.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\"/><text x=\"48.0\" y=\"227.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\" font-family=\"serif\">v<tspan font-size=\"14\" dy=\"4\">1</tspan><tspan font-size=\"17\" dy=\"-4\">′</tspan></text><text x=\"356.0\" y=\"227.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\" font-family=\"serif\">v<tspan font-size=\"14\" dy=\"4\">2</tspan><tspan font-size=\"17\" dy=\"-4\">′</tspan></text><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"247.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">băng đệm khí</text></svg></figure>"
